{"version":1,"content":"<p>法國多地上周六（17日）爆發的大規模示威演變為騷亂，民眾上街抗議物價上漲和公共服務質素下降，部分地區出現建築物遭縱火、大量店舖被洗劫，警方出動催淚氣體和水炮驅散群眾。</p><p>法國政府表示，全國約有55萬人上街，約1200人被拘，約150名警員受傷。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T03:39:21.918006+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T03:29:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T04:17:35.013749+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T03:38:11.517636+00:00","content_hash":"4a06f75b7db14a46a80168a7a55bae77af441bf9472054ba8013645918be055f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}